1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:01,267
India does not have

2
00:00:01,267 --> 00:00:02,300
one kind of biomass.

3
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,267
It has a different

4
00:00:03,267 --> 00:00:04,933
one in almost every region.

5
00:00:05,767 --> 00:00:07,367
In Punjab and Haryana,

6
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:08,733
it is paddy straw,

7
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:11,567
