8
00:00:12,067 --> 00:00:13,100
In Rajasthan,

9
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,467
mustard husk.

10
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:16,800
Across Gujarat and Maharashtra,

11
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,333
