21
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:37,500
The problem is distance.

22
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,700
The straw is in one state,

23
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,500
the factory that needs

24
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,967
it is in another,

25
00:00:42,967 --> 00:00:46,100
and neither knows the other exists.

26
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:49,700
IndiaBiomass is mapping who has what,

27
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:50,633
and where,

28
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:52,367
so supply and demand

29
00:00:52,367 --> 00:00:55,067
